4†US Academic & Government Discount Requests】\nL103:     * 【35†FAQs†utex.freshdesk.com】\nL104:     * 【36†Order Status】\nL105:     * 【37†Contact UTEX】\nL106: \nL107:   * 【32†Request A Quote】\nL108:   * 【38†FAQs†utex.freshdesk.com】\nL109: # Vitamin B_{12} Solution Component Recipe\nL110: \nL111: #### Directions\nL112: \nL113: #### For 200 mL Total\nL114: \nL115:   1. Prepare 200 mL of HEPES buffer.\nL116:   2. Adjust the pH to 7.8.\nL117:   3. Add Vitamin B_{12}  wait until fully dissolved.\nL118:   4. Sterilize by 0.45 µm Millipore filter. Store in dark at freezer temperature.\nL119: \nL120: ** The amount of vitamins added can vary from medium to medium so the final concentration is not listed.\nL121: #  | Component  | Amount  | Stock Solution Concentration  | Final Concentration\nL122: --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nL123: 1  | HEPES buffer pH 7.8\nL124: (Sigma H-3375)  | 2.4 g/200 mL dH_{2}O  | 50 mM  | **\nL125: 2  | Vitamin B_{12}\nL126: (cyanocobalamin, (Sigma V-6629))  | 0.027 g/200 mL dH_{2}O  | 0.1 mM  | **\nL127: \nL128: #### Note: Concentration listed is for the stock solution.\nL129: ### Follow UTEX\nL130: \nL131: Sign up for our newsletter to stay informed on any new products, services, and educational opportunities!\nL132: \nL133: [Input][Input] [Input]\nL134: \nL135: [Input] [Input: Please enter your email address...] [Input]\nL136: \nL137: * * *\nL138: \nL139:   * 【2†PRODUCTS】\nL140:   * 【41†Living Algal Strains】\nL141:   * 【4†Algae Express】\nL142:   * 【6†Algal Culture Media】\nL143:   * 【10†Bulk Volume Microalgae】\nL144:   * 【9†Teaching Kits】\nL145:   * 【11†UTEX Photobioreactor Packages】\nL146:   * 【12†RGB-LED Lighting Platform】\nL147:   * 【42†SERVICES】\nL148:   * 【14†Training Workshops】\nL149:   * 【15†UTEX Algal Images】\nL150:   * 【16†UTEX Genomic DNA】\nL151:   * 【17†Strain Identification】\nL152:   * 【18†Proprietary Strain Deposition】\nL153:   * 【19†Biochemical Analysis】\nL154:   * 【20†RESOURCES】\nL155:   * 【21†Culture Maintenance Guides】\nL156:   * 【22†